---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="The terms that apply to using the Klozdesk website. The product is pre-launch; pilot customers receive a separate agreement."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <Eyebrow>Terms</Eyebrow>
      <h1>Terms, <em>without the maze.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        These terms apply to this website. The Klozdesk product is pre-launch. Pilot customers
        receive a separate written agreement that governs the pilot.
      </p>
      <p class="small mt-1">Last updated: 18 November 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Klozdesk is a product of Sparkr Digitals, based in Nigeria. You can contact us at
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Using this site</h2>
        <p>
          You may use this website for lawful purposes only. Do not attempt to disrupt the site,
          gain unauthorized access, scrape it at scale, or use it to mislead others. We may
          suspend access where we reasonably believe these terms have been violated.
        </p>

        <h2>Product descriptions are forward-looking</h2>
        <p>
          Klozdesk is pre-launch. Descriptions of the product, workflow, integrations, and pilot
          on this site are informational and may change. They are not a commitment to deliver a
          specific feature, integration, or result. The written pilot agreement, not this page,
          governs what we deliver.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The Klozdesk name, logo, site design, copy, and other content are owned by us or our
          licensors. You may view and share links to the site, but you may not copy, modify,
          distribute, or use our brand assets without written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          The site may link to third-party websites or services. We do not control them and are
          not responsible for their content, terms, or privacy practices.
        </p>

        <h2>No warranties</h2>
        <p>
          This website is provided “as is” and “as available.” To the extent permitted by law, we
          make no warranties of any kind, express or implied, including fitness for a particular
          purpose, accuracy, or uninterrupted availability.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect, incidental, special,
          consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of this website. Nothing in
          these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria. Any dispute
          will be subject to the jurisdiction of the Nigerian courts, unless a separate written
          agreement says otherwise.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms as the website or the company changes. The date at the top of
          this page shows the latest version. Continued use of the site after an update means you
          accept the revised terms.
        </p>

        <div class="callout">
          <strong>Pilot customers:</strong> the pilot agreement, data processing agreement, and
          order form take precedence over this page for the pilot service.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
